            <ArticleTitle>[THE APPLICATION OF ANTIHOMOTOXIC DRUG PREPARATIONS IN THE COMPLEX TREATMENT IN PATIENTS WITH NEUROLOGICAL MANIFESTATIONS OF LUMBAR OSTEOCHONDROSIS].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>52-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The expediency of application homeosyniatry by preparations of Traumel S and Placenta Compositum after the offered chart in relation to a complex with classic acupuncture and in relation to the group of the generally accepted treatment has been proved in complex treatment patients with reflex syndromes of lumbar osteochondrosis. A similar conclusion was done after the statistically reliable (P &lt; 0.05) dynamics of parameters of endogenous intoxication, liperoxydation and antioxydant systems of the protection (by the level of katalase, superoxyddismutase, SH-groups, ceruloplasmine).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
